! DnDWiki Forgotten Realms

Forgotten Realms content for `dndwiki-core` (required). Contains no code, only data and texts:

* `$:/dndwiki/calendar/Harptos` - the Calendar of Harptos as calendar data (12 months of 30
  days, 5 festival days, Shieldmeet every 4 years)
* `$:/config/dndwiki/calendar` - makes Harptos the active calendar of the wiki
* Language keys `Calendar/Harptos/...` (en-GB, de-DE): name, era (DR), months, epithets,
  festivals, description. Month names and DR exist only in en-GB and are shown in English in
  every language

!! Own calendar

To use a different calendar, copy `$:/dndwiki/calendar/Harptos` into the wiki under a new
title, change `id`, months, days, festivals and leap rule, and point
`$:/config/dndwiki/calendar` to the new title. Display names go into
`$:/dndwiki/language/<code>/Calendar/<id>/...`; without them the ids are shown. This plugin is
not needed for that.
